00:01:46.290 --> 00:01:51.410
Chapter 16 Deceit

00:02:43.410 --> 00:02:47.180
What did you think? Was it to your liking?

00:02:50.580 --> 00:02:53.520
Show his lordship your face.

00:03:08.370 --> 00:03:09.390
This is...

00:03:12.370 --> 00:03:15.120
An intriguing plot, is it not?

00:03:15.120 --> 00:03:19.510
He is a killer I found at a
pleasure house in the gay quarter.

00:03:22.830 --> 00:03:27.000
I am Kichisaburo of Yogotoya.

00:03:27.000 --> 00:03:29.850
I am most pleased to
make your acquaintance.

00:03:30.450 --> 00:03:35.610
And what is it that you will show me?

00:03:36.080 --> 00:03:39.610
Anything it would please
you to see, my lord.

00:03:41.080 --> 00:03:42.820
What is anything?

00:03:45.500 --> 00:03:48.200
Is it blood that your
lordship wants to see?

00:03:48.200 --> 00:03:52.950
Or do you want to have fun with me?

00:03:52.950 --> 00:03:55.630
I can make both happen for you.

00:03:56.000 --> 00:03:58.700
You are being vulgar, Kichisaburo.

00:03:58.700 --> 00:04:02.720
There is something else that
we would like for you to do.

00:04:09.080 --> 00:04:13.790
A perfect role for someone
as thirsty for blood as you.

00:04:17.330 --> 00:04:21.110
So, who do I have to kill?

00:04:28.000 --> 00:04:29.200
I'm not done yet!

00:04:29.200 --> 00:04:32.370
Hey, if it isn't Tetsunosuke.

00:05:02.250 --> 00:05:04.370
He's gotten awfully fast.

00:05:04.370 --> 00:05:08.410
Hey, Heisuke, want me to take over?

00:05:10.950 --> 00:05:12.080
Be quiet!

00:05:12.330 --> 00:05:13.660
Keep your mouth shut!

00:05:34.790 --> 00:05:38.750
Well, you sure have been
applying yourself, little puppy boy.

00:05:38.750 --> 00:05:41.250
Not only are you cute,
but you're good with a sword, too!

00:05:41.250 --> 00:05:43.190
That's what a member of the
Shinsengumi should be like!

00:05:44.080 --> 00:05:47.570
Ah, well, you know...
It's all thanks to you guys.

00:05:47.910 --> 00:05:51.290
After all, you've been skipping your page
duties every chance you get to practice.

00:05:51.290 --> 00:05:53.790
Man, puppy boy, you did pretty good!

00:05:59.120 --> 00:06:02.340
Isn't this great, Mr. Kondo?

00:06:38.250 --> 00:06:40.000
What is it?!

00:06:41.660 --> 00:06:43.040
I'm sorry.

00:06:43.040 --> 00:06:45.580
Oh, that scared me!

00:06:45.580 --> 00:06:47.380
Just what is the big idea?!

00:06:49.330 --> 00:06:52.010
Actually, Tetsu was just in a match, and...

00:06:55.000 --> 00:06:59.060
I see. I didn't know Tetsu had come so far.

00:06:59.500 --> 00:07:03.790
Don't you think it's better for
him to be sweating at practice,

00:07:03.790 --> 00:07:05.400
rather than curled up in the closet?

00:07:05.700 --> 00:07:07.160
Yes, well...

00:07:08.120 --> 00:07:12.990
And you, Tatsunosuke, will get more
gray hairs if you keep worrying so much.

00:07:20.700 --> 00:07:22.000
Pardon me.

00:07:22.000 --> 00:07:24.940
I need to go out for a bit
to buy new account books.

00:07:36.160 --> 00:07:39.640
Do you think he'll be
okay like this, Saizo?

00:08:17.680 --> 00:08:23.140
Gallant Master Okita

00:08:20.290 --> 00:08:23.140
What're ya lookin' at so intently?

00:08:28.160 --> 00:08:29.570
What do you want?!

00:08:30.790 --> 00:08:32.990
Is Master Yoshida around?

00:08:34.370 --> 00:08:38.330
I cannot announce someone with
such a strange head covering!

00:08:38.790 --> 00:08:42.000
Oh, sorry about that.

00:08:42.000 --> 00:08:44.410
If ya tell him Saitaniya's
come a long way to see him,

00:08:44.410 --> 00:08:45.670
he'll know right quick.

00:08:46.620 --> 00:08:49.450
Saitaniya?

00:08:49.450 --> 00:08:51.760
Was there a shop like that?

00:08:53.000 --> 00:08:55.910
Oh, no! Please wait!

00:08:55.910 --> 00:08:58.330
It's all right, Hotaru. Let him through.

00:09:00.700 --> 00:09:05.080
Master Saitani, I have
heard much about you.

00:09:05.080 --> 00:09:06.230
Please come this way.

00:09:07.000 --> 00:09:07.900
Who're you?

00:09:08.580 --> 00:09:13.280
My name is Suzu, and I serve
as my master's right hand.

00:09:13.910 --> 00:09:16.950
Well, well. You've got pretty eyes.

00:09:24.910 --> 00:09:27.880
So, you'll not be persuaded,
no matter what I say?

00:09:31.040 --> 00:09:32.680
Here you are, Master Sakamoto.

00:09:34.580 --> 00:09:38.700
Sakamoto, you are a man of Tosa.

00:09:38.700 --> 00:09:41.540
We Choshu are cut down without
question if we walk the streets,

00:09:41.540 --> 00:09:43.750
and our heads hung from
gibbets along the Kamo River.

00:09:43.750 --> 00:09:46.770
You cannot possibly understand how we feel.

00:09:47.200 --> 00:09:48.600
I <i>don't </i>understand.

00:09:50.660 --> 00:09:55.330
If ya stir up trouble now,
the Choshu'll be crushed.

00:09:55.330 --> 00:09:58.660
Even yer representative, Mr. Katsura,
said to show restraint, remember?

00:09:59.580 --> 00:10:03.370
You're a direct disciple
of Master Shoin Yoshida.

00:10:03.370 --> 00:10:08.290
Won't ya put yer capable mind
to use for the future of Japan?

00:10:08.290 --> 00:10:12.290
No revolution will come about
if we are loath to lose our lives.

00:10:12.290 --> 00:10:13.750
Sakamoto,

00:10:13.750 --> 00:10:17.090
if you are also a patriotic loyalist,
take up your sword.

00:10:18.040 --> 00:10:20.060
I can't approve.

00:10:36.250 --> 00:10:37.550
It's not good...

00:10:38.680 --> 00:10:42.910
to be lookin' out at the world from a
window like this where the view's narrow.

00:10:43.160 --> 00:10:47.290
I know! Won't ya come to Hyogo with me?

00:10:47.290 --> 00:10:51.080
Master Katsu'll also be at
the navy's trainin' center.

00:10:51.080 --> 00:10:54.840
Ya can take a good look at the
big world from aboard a ship!

00:10:57.250 --> 00:11:00.840
I cannot, but I greatly
appreciate the thought behind it.

00:11:11.540 --> 00:11:13.560
Saitaniya...

00:11:15.950 --> 00:11:18.600
I have to go tell the gallant Master Okita!

00:11:20.070 --> 00:11:22.820
Masuya

00:11:36.200 --> 00:11:37.290
Tetsu...

00:11:44.660 --> 00:11:46.560
Gallant Master Okita...

00:11:50.540 --> 00:11:55.120
Oh, dear. What do I think I'm doing?

00:11:55.120 --> 00:11:56.830
<i>What a stupid child you are!</i>

00:11:56.830 --> 00:12:00.640
<i>You're a spy, and you're going to
go sell information to the enemy?!</i>

00:12:03.000 --> 00:12:05.950
<i>Hotaru! Acting without thinking again?!</i>

00:12:05.950 --> 00:12:09.420
<i>Do you have any idea how much trouble
I've had to go through because of you?!</i>

00:12:12.290 --> 00:12:16.630
Yugao! Utsusemi! I'm so sorry!

00:12:16.830 --> 00:12:20.120
I've quit being a spy already.

00:12:20.120 --> 00:12:23.290
But I still keep being
a bother to everyone.

00:12:23.290 --> 00:12:25.440
Even so, my feelings for
the gallant Master Okita...

00:12:33.790 --> 00:12:35.120
Gallant Master Okita?

00:12:38.700 --> 00:12:40.650
Gallant Master Okita!

00:12:41.250 --> 00:12:42.280
Who are you?

00:13:15.000 --> 00:13:16.560
Fire!

00:13:16.560 --> 00:13:20.160
Someone call the fire brigade!

00:13:34.450 --> 00:13:37.700
<i>When there's a fire, I
can't help but rush over.</i>

00:13:37.700 --> 00:13:38.970
<i>I hate that habit of mine.</i>

00:13:44.040 --> 00:13:45.870
What am I doing?

00:13:48.370 --> 00:13:49.410
What?

00:13:49.410 --> 00:13:51.350
Yeehaw!

00:13:52.540 --> 00:13:55.450
Who the heck is tossing garbage...?

00:13:58.160 --> 00:14:00.310
Oh, there was someone here?

00:14:01.040 --> 00:14:03.320
My bad, my bad.

00:14:10.450 --> 00:14:14.160
Dragon-boy!

00:14:16.660 --> 00:14:19.080
So, I dropped by a bath,
seein' how it'd been a while,

00:14:19.080 --> 00:14:21.130
and what do you know, this fire
pops up right before my eyes.

00:14:21.450 --> 00:14:26.040
Maybe it's a message from the
heavens tellin' me not to rest.

00:14:26.040 --> 00:14:27.420
I see.

00:14:28.040 --> 00:14:31.910
By the way, are you sure you should
be taking your time like that?

00:14:31.910 --> 00:14:36.140
I'm a member of the Shinsengumi,
who wants to capture you too.

00:14:36.140 --> 00:14:40.620
Yeah? What do you think you're sayin',
lookin' all nervous there?

00:14:40.620 --> 00:14:44.950
Ya need to have a bit more pluck and
think more 'bout actually <i>catchin' </i>me.

00:14:44.950 --> 00:14:48.070
Just like those Mimawarigumi over there.

00:14:48.070 --> 00:14:50.160
It's Ryoma Sakamoto!

00:14:50.500 --> 00:14:52.450
Get him!

00:14:56.160 --> 00:14:58.290
<i>What am I running for?</i>

00:14:58.620 --> 00:15:01.370
<i>I've got nothing to do with...</i>

00:15:01.370 --> 00:15:04.380
Partner, we're just goin'
to hafta outrun 'em!

00:15:06.000 --> 00:15:08.550
Whoa! A hill?!

00:15:10.620 --> 00:15:13.160
We've been surrounded, Mr. Sakamoto!

00:15:13.160 --> 00:15:16.060
Talk 'bout a wastefully
well-executed maneuver.

00:15:20.750 --> 00:15:23.270
Hell with it. Guess I'll go for it!

00:15:23.910 --> 00:15:26.790
I know you're strong,

00:15:26.790 --> 00:15:30.030
but how do you plan to fight
against this many people?

00:15:30.290 --> 00:15:34.120
Anyway, you take this.
Can't be havin' ya unarmed.

00:15:34.120 --> 00:15:35.660
What?!

00:15:36.540 --> 00:15:40.330
With these guys, this'll
be more than plenty.

00:15:41.660 --> 00:15:45.250
Dragon-boy, run to the cart!

00:15:46.830 --> 00:15:47.750
Yes, sir!

00:16:02.080 --> 00:16:03.070
The wheel!

00:16:04.910 --> 00:16:07.440
Don't let him get away! Knock him down!

00:16:17.910 --> 00:16:20.750
Mr. Sakamoto, if you don't
hurry up and get on...

00:16:26.040 --> 00:16:28.120
Don't worry!

00:16:28.120 --> 00:16:32.300
I haven't been runnin' away
all over Japan for nothin'!

00:16:32.870 --> 00:16:34.480
That's fine, but...

00:16:35.450 --> 00:16:39.760
how are we going to stop this thing?!

00:16:49.620 --> 00:16:54.240
Man, good thing we ended
up in an irrigation canal!

00:16:54.580 --> 00:16:57.450
I thought my heart would stop.

00:16:58.250 --> 00:17:02.200
Just so you know, I'm going
home as soon as I'm warmed up.

00:17:02.200 --> 00:17:06.660
If I stay with you, people may get
the wrong idea again and kill me.

00:17:06.660 --> 00:17:11.300
Now, now, a thrill once in a while's
a good thing. Makes ya feel alive.

00:17:11.580 --> 00:17:13.700
No thank you.

00:17:13.700 --> 00:17:16.890
Why are you always showing up
around me in the first place?

00:17:17.160 --> 00:17:18.830
It was a coincidence.

00:17:18.830 --> 00:17:22.000
I was meetin' with an
important client today.

00:17:22.000 --> 00:17:25.060
It's not like I was
stalkin' ya or anythin'.

00:17:25.330 --> 00:17:26.980
Important client?

00:17:27.290 --> 00:17:30.860
Someone out to turn this
capital upside down.

00:17:32.700 --> 00:17:35.240
It has nothing to do with me.

00:17:35.410 --> 00:17:39.500
Whoops, that's right. Better get
the water out of this here, too.

00:17:39.500 --> 00:17:43.240
It may look powerful, but it's
actually quite the delicate lady.

00:17:43.240 --> 00:17:45.420
I doubt the gunpowder's still good.

00:17:47.700 --> 00:17:50.830
Dragon-boy, you interested in this?

00:17:50.830 --> 00:17:51.910
No.

00:17:51.910 --> 00:17:54.410
It's okay not to be.

00:17:54.410 --> 00:17:56.660
This thing's a tool for killin' people.

00:17:56.660 --> 00:17:59.680
You don't need to be
interested in somethin' like that.

00:18:01.680 --> 00:18:05.500
Dragon-boy, take good care of yer life.

00:18:05.500 --> 00:18:09.100
You just run, run, run, run,
run yer butt off like me!

00:18:20.910 --> 00:18:23.520
Gallant Master Okita, why...?

00:18:26.660 --> 00:18:31.580
I am so sorry about what I did
earlier, hugging you like that.

00:18:32.620 --> 00:18:34.240
Er...
Yes?

00:18:35.370 --> 00:18:38.800
Do you remember me?

00:18:39.410 --> 00:18:43.300
How could I forget such an adorable face?

00:18:44.750 --> 00:18:46.750
Master Okita?

00:18:46.750 --> 00:18:48.720
Now, close your eyes.

00:18:53.910 --> 00:18:55.780
You can open them now.

00:19:03.200 --> 00:19:07.160
You're such a kind person, Master Okita.

00:19:07.160 --> 00:19:11.540
Why is such a kind person a
member of the Shinsengumi?

00:19:12.160 --> 00:19:14.750
Well, I wonder why...

00:19:15.910 --> 00:19:20.180
Maybe it's so that I can kill people.

00:19:22.290 --> 00:19:25.890
I love the sight of blood.

00:19:28.870 --> 00:19:32.400
I'm lying. Of course I'm not like that.

00:19:33.790 --> 00:19:37.580
It's getting late. I'll walk you home.

00:19:37.580 --> 00:19:39.560
No, that's fine.

00:19:40.790 --> 00:19:43.500
I'll be going home now.

00:19:49.950 --> 00:19:51.330
Damn.

00:19:56.450 --> 00:20:00.490
Were gallant Master Okita's
eyes always so cold-looking?

00:20:06.160 --> 00:20:08.910
But I still...

00:20:27.950 --> 00:20:30.190
Damn that Sakamoto.

00:20:30.190 --> 00:20:31.840
He totally gave us the slip.

00:20:31.840 --> 00:20:32.790
Yes, indeed.

00:20:33.330 --> 00:20:35.870
That pistol of his is just so dangerous.

00:20:35.870 --> 00:20:37.670
Yes, I agree.

00:20:38.250 --> 00:20:39.630
Looks perfect.

00:20:45.330 --> 00:20:48.110
Oh, if I recall correctly, you are
Okita of the Shinsengumi...

00:20:50.330 --> 00:20:51.350
What are you doing?!

00:20:54.080 --> 00:20:56.980
What the heck? You're so weak.

00:20:57.410 --> 00:20:58.830
Have you gone mad?!

00:20:58.830 --> 00:21:01.360
We are the Kyoto Mimawarigumi!

00:21:01.830 --> 00:21:05.320
My sword becomes dull
if I don't kill people.

00:21:12.290 --> 00:21:14.290
Murderer!

00:21:20.160 --> 00:21:23.050
Does that about do it, your lordship?

00:21:23.250 --> 00:21:25.040
Beautiful...

00:21:25.040 --> 00:21:28.250
What a beautiful sight, Kichisaburo!

00:21:28.250 --> 00:21:30.810
I have fallen in love
with you all over again.

00:21:38.870 --> 00:21:41.540
You're a real piece of work.

00:21:41.540 --> 00:21:43.900
I like you, your lordship.

00:22:03.620 --> 00:22:07.910
<i>Maiku o nigirishime
hitto pareedo no onpareedo</i>

00:22:07.910 --> 00:22:11.470
<i>Hey, Jimmy, kibun wa doudai?</i>

00:22:11.470 --> 00:22:15.790
<i>Suteeji orireba sasuga no jentoruman</i>

00:22:15.790 --> 00:22:19.520
<i>Hey, Jimmy, kokoro mo kandai!</i>

00:22:19.520 --> 00:22:23.400
<i>Jimichi ga yue ni seikatsu sae mo jimi ni</i>

00:22:23.400 --> 00:22:27.290
<i>Kotsu-kotsu tsumiagemashou</i>

00:22:27.290 --> 00:22:31.290
<i>Jimichi ni yume ga kanaimasu you ni</i>

00:22:31.290 --> 00:22:35.080
<i>Kyou mo, Jimmy, ikimashou</i>

00:22:37.040 --> 00:22:40.660
<i>You got to fight for your money!
How you feeling, Jimmy?</i>

00:22:40.660 --> 00:22:44.590
<i>You got to fight for your dream,
it's all too much</i>

00:22:44.590 --> 00:22:48.500
<i>You got to fight for your money!
How you feeling, Jimmy?</i>

00:22:48.500 --> 00:22:52.640
<i>You got to fight for your dream,
it's all too much</i>

00:23:08.280 --> 00:23:12.030
<i>You got to fight for your money!
How you feeling, Jimmy?</i>

00:23:12.030 --> 00:23:16.040
<i>You got to fight for your dream,
it's all too much</i>

00:23:16.040 --> 00:23:20.080
<i>You got to fight for your money!
How you feeling, Jimmy?</i>

00:23:20.080 --> 00:23:24.330
<i>You got to fight for your dream,
it's all too much</i>

00:23:25.710 --> 00:23:29.920
Next Peacemaker Kurogane

00:23:26.200 --> 00:23:28.330
<i>The color of blood is beautiful.</i>

00:23:28.330 --> 00:23:30.960
<i>Master Okita, you're scaring me!</i>

00:23:30.960 --> 00:23:35.430
<i>Next time, Peacemaker Kurogane,
Chapter 17: "Hollow."</i>

00:23:35.020 --> 00:23:40.680
Chapter 17 Hollow

00:23:36.200 --> 00:23:40.330
<i>I shall accompany you on
the path through darkness.</i>
